        ['箱子的 L/W/H 到底哪個方向是哪個？','系統預設 L（長）為對應貨櫃「深度」方向，W（寬）為對應「左右寬度」方向，H（高）固定為垂直方向。水平擺放時 L 和 W 可以互換（這就是裝載方向策略在控制的事）。'],
        ['設備不能翻轉，系統有考慮這個嗎？','有。系統只允許箱體繞垂直軸（Y軸）旋轉，也就是 L 和 W 可以互換，但 H（高度）永遠是垂直方向，不會讓設備側放或倒置。'],
        ['空間利用率怎麼提高？','① 縮小各方向預留空間 → ② 嘗試深層優化 → ③ 調低支撐閾值（如改為 30~40%）→ ④ 若有多種箱型，考慮混裝（數量都設為 0，讓系統自動填滿）。'],
        ['DXF 檔案輸出後在 CAD 裡看不到圖形？','DXF 比例為 1:40，實際圖形可能很小。請在 CAD 中使用「全部縮放」（ZOOM → ALL）或「範圍縮放」（ZOOM → EXTENT）指令讓所有圖形顯示在視窗內。'],
        ['「儲存設定」和「截圖」有什麼不同？','截圖：把當前畫面（含3D圖）存成JPG圖片，僅供檢視。儲存設定：把輸入數據封裝進HTML檔，收到的人可以繼續互動操作、重新計算，就像從未關閉視窗一樣。'],
      ].map(([q,a],i)=>(
        <div key={i} className="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <div className="px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 font-semibold text-sm text-slate-800 flex gap-2"><span className="text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0">Q.</span>{q}</div>
          <div className="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed flex gap-2"><span className="text-emerald-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">A.</span>{a}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  ];

  const content_ja = [
    <div className="p-5 space-y-2">
      <p className="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">以下の 5 ステップで積載試算を完了できます：</p>
      <Step n="1" title="コンテナ種類を選択">左上のドロップダウンから使用するコンテナ規格を選択してください。</Step>
      <Step n="2" title="余白を設定">コンテナ四方向の余白（mm）を入力します。固定金具やバンド・緩衝材のスペースを考慮してください。</Step>
      <Step n="3" title="箱情報を追加">「＋ 箱を追加」をクリックし、外寸 L×W×H（mm）と数量を入力します。数量 0 は「できる限り詰める」を意味します。</Step>
      <Step n="4" title="戦略を選択して計算">積載方向戦略を選んでから「標準計算」をクリック。数秒で 3D 積載図と結果概要が表示されます。</Step>
      <Step n="5" title="結果確認・深層最適化">総積載数と空間利用率を確認します。さらに利用率を上げたい場合は「深層最適化 (GRASP)」を使用してください。</Step>
      <Tip>初めての方はまず「標準計算」で基本結果を確認し、必要に応じて深層最適化を使用することをお勧めします。</Tip>
    </div>,
    <div className="p-5">
      <Field name="コンテナ種類" type="ドロップダウン">20' GP：奥行約5867mm。40' GP：奥行約11998mm（最一般的）。40' HQ：40' GPより高さが約305mm増加。</Field>
      <Field name="各方向余白" type="数値 mm">最奥部・ドア側・右側・上部それぞれの余白を設定。固定金具・ドア開閉・バンド通し・頂部断熱材のスペースです。</Field>
      <Field name="支持面積しきい値 (%)" type="スライダー 20~80%">50%（デフォルト）：底面の半分以上が支持されれば配置可能。20~30%：緩やか設定で積載率向上。70~80%：精密機器向け厳格設定。</Field>
      <Field name="長(L) / 幅(W) / 高さ(H)" type="数値 mm">外箱の実寸を入力。H は垂直固定（上下反転不可）。L と W は水平回転で入れ替え可能。</Field>
      <Field name="数量・公差・計算基準" type="数値 + ドロップダウン">数量 0 で自動最大充填。公差と計算基準の組み合わせで最悪・最良・平均ケースをシミュレーション。</Field>
    </div>,
    <div className="p-5">
      <Btn label="標準計算" color="bg-blue-600">1回の高速演算（約1秒）。単純な箱構成や初回確認に最適。</Btn>
      <Btn label="深層最適化 (GRASP)" color="bg-indigo-600">100回のランダム反復で最良解を探索（約5~15秒）。複雑な混載に効果的。</Btn>
      <Btn label="3面図を出力 (.dxf)" color="bg-indigo-600">積載結果を1:40スケールのDXF形式で出力。計算後のみ有効。</Btn>
      <Btn label="設定を保存 (.html)" color="bg-emerald-600">現在の入力設定（コンテナ種類・余白・箱体寸法など）をHTMLファイルに埋め込みます。同僚に送るとそのまま同じ設定で作業を継続できます。計算結果は保存されません。</Btn>
      <Btn label="撮影・等角/平面/正面/側面" color="bg-teal-600">撮影：高解像度JPG保存。視点ボタン：3D視点の切替。</Btn>
      <Btn label="透過・積載順序スライダー" color="bg-slate-500">透過：半透明で内部確認。スライダー：積載順序をステップ表示。マウス左：回転、右：移動、ホイール：縮尺。</Btn>
    </div>,
    <div className="p-5">
      <Info icon="📦" label="総積載箱数">有効スペースに収まった全箱種の合計数。</Info>
      <Info icon="📊" label="空間利用率 (%)">（全箱体積合計 ÷ コンテナ内部総容積）× 100%。70%以上が良好、80%以上が優秀。</Info>
      <Info icon="📏" label="残りスペース">Z（奥行）・X（幅）・Y（高さ）それぞれの方向で最後の箱から有効端までの距離。「余白含」表示は余白を加えた実際の隙間です。</Info>
      <Warn>空間利用率が100%未満でも「積載不足」警告が出ることがあります。残りスペースが細切れになり、箱がどの向きでも入らない「デッドスペース」が生じるためです。</Warn>
      <Tip>不足が発生した場合：① 深層最適化を試す → ② 余白を縮小 → ③ 40' HQ に変更して高さを増やす。</Tip>
    </div>,
    <div className="p-5 space-y-4">
      {[
        ['「自動」戦略と手動選択の結果が同じになるのはなぜですか？','「自動」はL優先とW優先の両方を実行し、積載数の多い方を採用します。両方同じ結果の場合は同一表示になります。'],
        ['深層最適化が標準計算より良くならないことはありますか？','あります。ランダム性があるため、箱種が単純な場合は標準計算がすでに最適解に近いことがほとんどです。'],
        ['公差機能はいつ使いますか？','外注製造の箱で実寸に誤差がある場合に使用。標称600mm±2mmなら、正公差2・負公差2・計算基準「最大」で最悪ケースを検証できます。'],
        ['DXFファイルをCADで開いても図形が見えません。','縮尺1:40のため図形が非常に小さく表示される場合があります。CADで「ZOOM → ALL」または「ZOOM → EXTENT」を実行してください。'],
        ['「設定を保存」と「撮影」の違いは何ですか？','撮影：現在の画面（3D図を含む）をJPG画像として保存します（閲覧のみ）。設定を保存：入力データをHTMLファイルに埋め込みます。受け取った人は同じ設定で操作・再計算を続けられます。'],
      ].map(([q,a],i)=>(
        <div key={i} className="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <div className="px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 font-semibold text-sm text-slate-800 flex gap-2"><span className="text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0">Q.</span>{q}</div>
          <div className="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed flex gap-2"><span className="text-emerald-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">A.</span>{a}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  ];

  const contents = zh ? content_zh : content_ja;

  return (
    <div className="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-sm p-3">
      <div className="modal-in bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-3xl max-h-[92vh] flex flex-col overflow-hidden">
        <div className="p-4 border-b border-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 flex-shrink-0">
          <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Ico.Book c="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600"/>
            <h2 className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">{zh?'貨櫃裝載計算器 — 完整使用說明':'コンテナ積載計算ツール — 操作ガイド'}</h2>
          </div>
          <button onClick={onClose} className="text-slate-400 hover:text-red-500 p-1 rounded-full hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors">
            <Ico.X c="w-5 h-5"/>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div className="flex border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 flex-shrink-0 overflow-x-auto">
          {tabs.map((tb,i)=>(
            <button key={i} onClick={()=>setTab(i)}
              className={'px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition-colors border-b-2 '+(tab===i?'border-blue-600 text-blue-700 bg-white':'border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100')}>
              {tb}
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div className="flex-1 overflow-y-auto scr">{contents[tab]}</div>
        <div className="p-4 border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 flex justify-between items-center flex-shrink-0">
          <div className="flex gap-2">
            <button onClick={()=>setTab(t=>Math.max(0,t-1))} disabled={tab===0} className="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-300 text-slate-600 disabled:opacity-30 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors">
              {zh?'◀ 上一頁':'◀ 前へ'}
            </button>
            <button onClick={()=>setTab(t=>Math.min(tabs.length-1,t+1))} disabled={tab===tabs.length-1} className="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs rounded-lg border border-slate-300 text-slate-600 disabled:opacity-30 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors">
              {zh?'下一頁 ▶':'次へ ▶'}
            </button>
          </div>
          <span className="text-xs text-slate-400">{tab+1} / {tabs.length}</span>
          <button onClick={onClose} className="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors">
            {zh?'關閉':'閉じる'}
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

// ── メインアプリ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function App(){
  // ── 載入預存狀態（如果有） ────────────────────────────────────────────
  const PS = window.PRELOADED_STATE;

  const [lang, setLang] = useState(PS?.lang || 'zh');
  const t = T[lang];

  const [ctnType,  setCtnType]  = useState(PS?.ctnType  || '20GP');
  const [doorGap,  setDoorGap]  = useState(PS?.doorGap  ?? 248);
  const [innerGap, setInnerGap] = useState(PS?.innerGap ?? 20);
  const [rightGap, setRightGap] = useState(PS?.rightGap ?? 10);
  const [topGap,   setTopGap]   = useState(PS?.topGap   ?? 50);
  const [suppPct,  setSuppPct]  = useState(PS?.suppPct  ?? 50);
  const [strat,    setStrat]    = useState(PS?.strat    || 'auto');

  const [boxes, setBoxes] = useState(PS?.boxes || [{
    id:uid(), name:'紙箱 A', L:600, W:400, H:400,
    color:COLORS[0], qty:0, tolPlus:0, tolMinus:0, calcMode:'nominal'
  }]);

  const [result, setResult] = useState({packed:[], stats:null});
  const [loading, setLoading]   = useState(false);
  const [graspOn, setGraspOn]   = useState(false);
  const [progress, setProgress] = useState(0);
  const [step, setStep]         = useState(0);
  const [xray, setXray]         = useState(false);
  const [helpOpen, setHelpOpen] = useState(false);
  const [fixOpen,  setFixOpen]  = useState(false);
  const [saveOpen, setSaveOpen] = useState(false);
  const [showPreloadBanner, setShowPreloadBanner] = useState(!!PS);

  useEffect(()=>{
    if(showPreloadBanner){
      const t=setTimeout(()=>setShowPreloadBanner(false), 4000);
      return ()=>clearTimeout(t);
    }
  },[showPreloadBanner]);

  const canvasRef   = useRef(null);
  const meshesRef   = useRef([]);
  const dimRef      = useRef(null);
  const camRef      = useRef(null);
  const ctrlRef     = useRef(null);

  // ── 儲存為HTML ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  const doSaveHtml = useCallback(() => {
    // 收集當前狀態
    const state = {
      lang, ctnType, doorGap, innerGap, rightGap, topGap, suppPct, strat, boxes
    };
    const stateJson = JSON.stringify(state);

    // 取得當前HTML全文
    const htmlSource = document.documentElement.outerHTML;

    // 替換 preloaded-state script 內容
    const newScript = `<script id="preloaded-state">\n  window.PRELOADED_STATE = ${stateJson};\n  <\/script>`;
    const updatedHtml = htmlSource.replace(
      /<script id="preloaded-state">[\s\S]*?<\/script>/,
      newScript
    );

    // 下載
    const blob = new Blob(['<!DOCTYPE html>\n' + updatedHtml], {type:'text/html;charset=utf-8'});
    const url  = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    const a    = document.createElement('a');
    const ts   = new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10).replace(/-/g,'');
    a.href     = url;
    a.download = `Container_Settings_${ctnType}_${ts}.html`;
    document.body.appendChild(a);
    a.click();
    document.body.removeChild(a);
    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
  }, [lang, ctnType, doorGap, innerGap, rightGap, topGap, suppPct, strat, boxes]);

  const doShot = () => {
    const el=document.getElementById('app-root');
    if(window.htmlToImage){
      window.htmlToImage.toJpeg(el,{quality:.95,backgroundColor:'#f8fafc',pixelRatio:2})
        .then(url=>{const a=document.createElement('a');a.download='Container_'+Date.now()+'.jpg';a.href=url;a.click();});
    }
  };

  const doCalc = (deep) => {
    setLoading(true);
    if(deep){setGraspOn(true);setProgress(0);}
    setTimeout(()=>{
      const c=CONTAINERS[ctnType];
      const maxX=Math.max(0,c.w-rightGap);
      const maxY=Math.max(0,c.h-topGap);
      const maxZ=Math.max(0,c.d-doorGap);
      const thr=suppPct/100;

      let best=[], bestVol=-1;
      const tryIt=(arr)=>{const v=arr.reduce((s,p)=>s+p.w*p.h*p.d,0);if(v>bestVol){bestVol=v;best=arr;}};

      if(strat==='auto'){
        tryIt(simulate(boxes,innerGap,maxX,maxY,maxZ,'length',thr,false));
        tryIt(simulate(boxes,innerGap,maxX,maxY,maxZ,'width', thr,false));
      }else{
        tryIt(simulate(boxes,innerGap,maxX,maxY,maxZ,strat,thr,false));
      }

      if(!deep){finalize(best,c,maxX,maxY,maxZ);return;}

      const ITER=100; let cur=0;
      const loop=()=>{
        for(let i=0;i<5&&cur<ITER;i++){
          let s2=strat==='auto'?(Math.random()>0.5?'length':'width'):strat;
          tryIt(simulate(boxes,innerGap,maxX,maxY,maxZ,s2,thr,true));
          if(cur%10===0){
            tryIt(simulate(boxes,innerGap,maxX,maxY,maxZ,'length',thr,true));
            tryIt(simulate(boxes,innerGap,maxX,maxY,maxZ,'width', thr,true));
          }
          cur++;
        }
        setProgress(Math.round(cur/ITER*100));
        if(cur<ITER) setTimeout(loop,10);
        else finalize(best,c,maxX,maxY,maxZ);
      };
      loop();
    },50);
  };

  const finalize=(packed,c,maxX,maxY,maxZ)=>{
    let vol=0; const counts={};
    packed.forEach(p=>{vol+=p.w*p.h*p.d;counts[p.typeId]=(counts[p.typeId]||0)+1;});
    const rem={w:getGaps(packed,c,'X',maxX),h:getGaps(packed,c,'Y',maxY),d:getGaps(packed,c,'Z',maxZ)};
    const warns=[];
    boxes.forEach(b=>{if(b.qty>0&&(counts[b.id]||0)<b.qty) warns.push({name:b.name,color:b.color,req:b.qty,pk:counts[b.id]||0,lack:b.qty-(counts[b.id]||0)});});
    setResult({packed,stats:{total:packed.length,util:((vol/(c.w*c.h*c.d))*100).toFixed(2),vol,counts,warns,rem}});
    setStep(packed.length);
    setLoading(false);setGraspOn(false);
  };

  // ── 3D Scene ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  useEffect(()=>{
    if(!canvasRef.current||!window.THREE) return;
    const THREE=window.THREE;
    canvasRef.current.innerHTML='';
    meshesRef.current=[];
    const W=canvasRef.current.clientWidth, H=canvasRef.current.clientHeight;
    const scene=new THREE.Scene(); scene.background=new THREE.Color(0xf1f5f9);
    const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45,W/H,1,100000); camRef.current=camera;
    const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});
    renderer.setSize(W,H); canvasRef.current.appendChild(renderer.domElement);
    const controls=new THREE.OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);
    controls.enableDamping=true; ctrlRef.current=controls;
    scene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff,.6));
    const dl=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,.6); dl.position.set(10000,20000,10000); scene.add(dl);

    const c=CONTAINERS[ctnType];
    scene.add(new THREE.LineSegments(
      new THREE.EdgesGeometry(new THREE.BoxGeometry(c.w,c.h,c.d)),
      new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0x334155,linewidth:2})
    ));

    const eX0=-c.w/2, eX1=eX0+(c.w-rightGap);
    const eY0=-c.h/2, eY1=eY0+(c.h-topGap);
    const eZ0=-c.d/2+innerGap, eZ1=c.d/2-doorGap;

    const corners=[
      new THREE.Vector3(eX0,eY0,eZ0),new THREE.Vector3(eX1,eY0,eZ0),
      new THREE.Vector3(eX0,eY1,eZ0),new THREE.Vector3(eX1,eY1,eZ0),
      new THREE.Vector3(eX0,eY0,eZ1),new THREE.Vector3(eX1,eY0,eZ1),
      new THREE.Vector3(eX0,eY1,eZ1),new THREE.Vector3(eX1,eY1,eZ1)
    ];
    const edges=[[0,1],[2,3],[4,5],[6,7],[0,2],[1,3],[4,6],[5,7],[0,4],[1,5],[2,6],[3,7]];
    const dpts=[];
    edges.forEach(([i,j])=>{
      const p1=corners[i],p2=corners[j],dist=p1.distanceTo(p2),dir=new THREE.Vector3().subVectors(p2,p1).normalize();
      let cc=0;
      while(cc<dist){
        let n=Math.min(cc+150,dist);
        dpts.push(p1.clone().add(dir.clone().multiplyScalar(cc)),p1.clone().add(dir.clone().multiplyScalar(n)));
        cc+=190;if(cc>=dist)break;
        n=Math.min(cc+15,dist);
        dpts.push(p1.clone().add(dir.clone().multiplyScalar(cc)),p1.clone().add(dir.clone().multiplyScalar(n)));
        cc+=55;if(cc>=dist)break;
        n=Math.min(cc+15,dist);
        dpts.push(p1.clone().add(dir.clone().multiplyScalar(cc)),p1.clone().add(dir.clone().multiplyScalar(n)));
        cc+=55;
      }
    });
    scene.add(new THREE.LineSegments(
      new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(dpts),
      new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xef4444,linewidth:2})
    ));

    const grp=new THREE.Group();
    result.packed.forEach(p=>{
      const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(
        new THREE.BoxGeometry(p.w,p.h,p.d),
        new THREE.MeshLambertMaterial({color:p.color})
      );
      mesh.position.set(p.x+p.w/2-c.w/2,p.y+p.h/2-c.h/2,p.z+p.d/2-c.d/2);
      mesh.add(new THREE.LineSegments(
        new THREE.EdgesGeometry(mesh.geometry),
        new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0x000000,transparent:true,opacity:.3})
      ));
      meshesRef.current.push(mesh); grp.add(mesh);
    });
    scene.add(grp);

    const dimGrp=new THREE.Group(); dimRef.current=dimGrp;
    if(result.stats?.rem&&result.packed.length>0){
      const {w:gW,h:gH,d:gD}=result.stats.rem;

      const addL=(p1,p2,col)=>dimGrp.add(new THREE.Line(
        new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints([p1,p2]),
        new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:col,transparent:true,opacity:.4})
      ));

      const addD=(p1,p2,txt,col,sx,sy,sz)=>{
        dimGrp.add(new THREE.Line(
          new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints([p1,p2]),
          new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:col,linewidth:2})
        ));
        const mid=new THREE.Vector3().addVectors(p1,p2).multiplyScalar(.5).add(new THREE.Vector3(sx,sy,sz));
        const cv=document.createElement('canvas'); cv.width=1536; cv.height=150;
        const ctx=cv.getContext('2d');
        ctx.fillStyle=col; ctx.font='bold 55px sans-serif'; ctx.textAlign='center'; ctx.textBaseline='middle';
        ctx.strokeStyle='white'; ctx.lineWidth=8;
        ctx.strokeText(txt,768,75); ctx.fillText(txt,768,75);
        const sp=new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:new THREE.CanvasTexture(cv),transparent:true}));
        sp.scale.set(3072,300,1); sp.position.copy(mid); dimGrp.add(sp);
      };

      const lX=eX1, lY=eY1, lZ=eZ1, y0=eY0;

      gW.forEach((g,i)=>{
        if(g>0){
          const off=400+i*300;
          const p1=new THREE.Vector3(lX-g, y0, lZ+off);
          const p2=new THREE.Vector3(lX,   y0, lZ+off);
          addL(new THREE.Vector3(lX-g, y0, lZ), p1, '#2563eb');
          addL(new THREE.Vector3(lX,   y0, lZ), p2, '#2563eb');
          addD(p1,p2, t.remW+': '+g+'mm ('+t.remInc+': '+(g+rightGap)+'mm)', '#2563eb', 0, 0, 150);
        }
      });

      gH.forEach((g,i)=>{
        if(g>0){
          const off=600+i*400;
          const p1=new THREE.Vector3(lX, lY-g, lZ+off);
          const p2=new THREE.Vector3(lX, lY,   lZ+off);
          addL(new THREE.Vector3(lX, lY-g, lZ), p1, '#16a34a');
          addL(new THREE.Vector3(lX, lY,   lZ), p2, '#16a34a');
          addD(p1,p2, t.remH+': '+g+'mm ('+t.remInc+': '+(g+topGap)+'mm)', '#16a34a', 200, 0, 300);
        }
      });

      gD.forEach((g,i)=>{
        if(g>0){
          const off=400+i*300;
          const p1=new THREE.Vector3(lX, y0-off, lZ-g);
          const p2=new THREE.Vector3(lX, y0-off, lZ);
          addL(new THREE.Vector3(lX, y0, lZ-g), p1, '#ea580c');
          addL(new THREE.Vector3(lX, y0, lZ),   p2, '#ea580c');
          addD(p1,p2, t.remD+': '+g+'mm ('+t.remInc+': '+(g+doorGap)+'mm)', '#ea580c', 0, -300, 0);
        }
      });
    }
    scene.add(dimGrp);

    camera.position.set(c.w*1.8,c.h*1.8,c.d*1.5); controls.update();
    const animate=()=>{requestAnimationFrame(animate);controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);};
    animate();
    const onResize=()=>{
      if(!canvasRef.current)return;
      camera.aspect=canvasRef.current.clientWidth/canvasRef.current.clientHeight;
      camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
      renderer.setSize(canvasRef.current.clientWidth,canvasRef.current.clientHeight);
    };
    window.addEventListener('resize',onResize);
    return()=>{window.removeEventListener('resize',onResize);renderer.dispose();};
  },[result,ctnType,doorGap,innerGap,rightGap,topGap,lang]);

  useEffect(()=>{
    meshesRef.current.forEach((m,i)=>{
      m.visible=i<step;
      m.material.transparent=xray;
      m.material.opacity=xray?.3:1;
      m.material.depthWrite=!xray;
    });
    if(dimRef.current) dimRef.current.visible=(step===result.packed.length&&result.packed.length>0);
  },[step,xray,result]);

  const changeView=(v)=>{
    const c=CONTAINERS[ctnType], cam=camRef.current, ctrl=ctrlRef.current;
    if(!cam||!ctrl) return;
    ctrl.target.set(0,0,0);
    if(v==='iso')   cam.position.set(c.w*1.8,c.h*1.8,c.d*1.5);
    if(v==='top')   cam.position.set(0,Math.max(c.w,c.d)*1.5,.1);
    if(v==='front') cam.position.set(0,0,c.d*1.8);
    if(v==='side')  cam.position.set(c.d*1.8,0,0);
    ctrl.update();
  };

  const doExport=()=>{
    if(!result.packed.length) return;
    const c=CONTAINERS[ctnType], sc=1/40, gap=1500*sc, eps=1e-4;
    let dxf='0\nSECTION\n2\nENTITIES\n';
    const ln=(x1,y1,x2,y2,lay,col)=>{dxf+='0\nLINE\n8\n'+lay+'\n62\n'+col+'\n10\n'+x1.toFixed(4)+'\n20\n'+y1.toFixed(4)+'\n30\n0.0\n11\n'+x2.toFixed(4)+'\n21\n'+y2.toFixed(4)+'\n31\n0.0\n';};
    const rect=(x,y,w,h,l,co)=>{ln(x,y,x+w,y,l,co);ln(x+w,y,x+w,y+h,l,co);ln(x+w,y+h,x,y+h,l,co);ln(x,y+h,x,y,l,co);};
    const aci=id=>{const i=boxes.findIndex(b=>b.id===id);return [5,1,3,2,6,4][i%6]||7;};
    const cW=c.w*sc,cH=c.h*sc,cD=c.d*sc;
    rect(0,0,cW,cH,'CONTAINER',7);
    rect(0,cH+gap,cW,cD,'CONTAINER',7);
    rect(cW+gap,0,cD,cH,'CONTAINER',7);
    const clip=(segs,lo,hi)=>{let r=[];for(const s of segs){if(hi<=s.s+eps||lo>=s.e-eps){r.push(s);}else{if(lo>s.s+eps)r.push({s:s.s,e:lo});if(hi<s.e-eps)r.push({s:hi,e:s.e});}}return r;};
    const pview=(faces,dx,dy)=>{
      for(let i=0;i<faces.length;i++){
        const F=faces[i];
        let tS=[{s:F.x,e:F.x+F.w}],bS=[{s:F.x,e:F.x+F.w}],lS=[{s:F.y,e:F.y+F.h}],rS=[{s:F.y,e:F.y+F.h}];
        for(let j=0;j<faces.length;j++){
          if(i===j)continue;
          const O=faces[j];
          if(O.depth>F.depth+eps){
            if(O.y-eps<=F.y+F.h&&F.y+F.h<=O.y+O.h+eps)tS=clip(tS,O.x,O.x+O.w);
            if(O.y-eps<=F.y&&F.y<=O.y+O.h+eps)bS=clip(bS,O.x,O.x+O.w);
            if(O.x-eps<=F.x&&F.x<=O.x+O.w+eps)lS=clip(lS,O.y,O.y+O.h);
            if(O.x-eps<=F.x+F.w&&F.x+F.w<=O.x+O.w+eps)rS=clip(rS,O.y,O.y+O.h);
          }
        }
        tS.forEach(s=>{if(s.e-s.s>eps)ln(s.s+dx,F.y+F.h+dy,s.e+dx,F.y+F.h+dy,F.lay,F.col);});
        bS.forEach(s=>{if(s.e-s.s>eps)ln(s.s+dx,F.y+dy,s.e+dx,F.y+dy,F.lay,F.col);});
        lS.forEach(s=>{if(s.e-s.s>eps)ln(F.x+dx,s.s+dy,F.x+dx,s.e+dy,F.lay,F.col);});
        rS.forEach(s=>{if(s.e-s.s>eps)ln(F.x+F.w+dx,s.s+dy,F.x+F.w+dx,s.e+dy,F.lay,F.col);});
      }
    };
    pview(result.packed.map(p=>({x:p.x*sc,y:p.y*sc,w:p.w*sc,h:p.h*sc,depth:(p.z+p.d)*sc,col:aci(p.typeId),lay:'FRONT'})),0,0);
    pview(result.packed.map(p=>({x:p.x*sc,y:cD-(p.z+p.d)*sc,w:p.w*sc,h:p.d*sc,depth:(p.y+p.h)*sc,col:aci(p.typeId),lay:'TOP'})),0,cH+gap);
    pview(result.packed.map(p=>({x:cD-(p.z+p.d)*sc,y:p.y*sc,w:p.d*sc,h:p.h*sc,depth:(p.x+p.w)*sc,col:aci(p.typeId),lay:'SIDE'})),cW+gap,0);
    dxf+='0\nENDSEC\n0\nEOF\n';
    const blob=new Blob([dxf],{type:'application/dxf'});
    const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='3view_'+ctnType+'.dxf';
    document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();document.body.removeChild(a);URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
  };

  const c=CONTAINERS[ctnType];
  const hasPacked=result.packed.length>0;

  return (
    <div id="app-root" className="min-h-screen p-4 md:p-6 bg-slate-50">

      {helpOpen && <HelpModal onClose={()=>setHelpOpen(false)} lang={lang}/>}
      {saveOpen && <SaveHtmlModal onClose={()=>setSaveOpen(false)} onSave={doSaveHtml} lang={lang} t={t}/>}

      {fixOpen && (
        <Modal onClose={()=>setFixOpen(false)} title={t.fixTitle} wide={false}>
          <div className="p-4 space-y-3">
            {[t.fix1,t.fix2,t.fix3,t.fix4,t.fix5,t.fix6,t.fix7].map((f,i)=>(
              <div key={i} className="flex items-start p-3 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg border border-emerald-100">
                <span className="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white text-xs flex items-center justify-center mr-2.5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">{i+1}</span>
                <span className="text-sm text-slate-700">{f}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </Modal>
      )}

      {/* 預載入狀態提示橫幅 */}
      {showPreloadBanner && (
        <div className="fixed top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-50 bg-emerald-600 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium pointer-events-none"
          style={{animation:'fadeUp .3s ease-out'}}>
          <Ico.Chk c="w-4 h-4"/>
          {t.preloadBanner}
        </div>
      )}

      <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-6">
        {/* Header */}
        <header className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-slate-200 gap-3">
          <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
            <Ico.Pkg c="w-8 h-8 text-blue-600"/>
            <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
              {t.title}
              <button onClick={()=>setFixOpen(true)} className="text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-md border border-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-200 transition-colors">
                {'Ver.'+APP_VER+' · '+APP_DATE+' '+t.by}
              </button>
            </h1>
          </div>
          <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <button onClick={doExport} disabled={!hasPacked} className={'flex items-center px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm shadow-sm transition-colors '+(hasPacked?'bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white':'bg-slate-200 text-slate-400 cursor-not-allowed')}>
              <Ico.Dl c="w-4 h-4 mr-1.5"/>{t.export}
            </button>
            {/* ★ 新增：儲存設定按鈕 */}
            <button onClick={()=>setSaveOpen(true)} className="flex items-center bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm shadow-sm transition-colors">
              <Ico.Save c="w-4 h-4 mr-1.5"/>{t.saveHtml}
            </button>
            <button onClick={doShot} className="flex items-center bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm shadow-sm transition-colors">
              <Ico.Cam c="w-4 h-4 mr-1.5"/>{t.shot}
            </button>
            <button onClick={()=>setHelpOpen(true)} className="flex items-center bg-blue-100 hover:bg-blue-200 text-blue-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm shadow-sm font-medium transition-colors">
              <Ico.Book c="w-4 h-4 mr-1.5"/>{t.helpBtn}
            </button>
            <button onClick={()=>setLang(l=>l==='zh'?'ja':'zh')} className="flex items-center bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm shadow-sm transition-colors">
              <Ico.Glob c="w-4 h-4 mr-1.5"/>{t.lang}
            </button>
          </div>
        </header>

        <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
          {/* 左側パネル */}
          <div className="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5">
            {/* 貨櫃設定 */}
            <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
              <h2 className="text-base font-semibold flex items-center mb-1"><Ico.Box c="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-slate-500"/>{t.ctnSet}</h2>
              <p className="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-3 ml-6">{t.ctnSub}</p>
              <select className="w-full p-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 mb-4 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none text-sm"
                value={ctnType} onChange={e=>{setCtnType(e.target.value);setResult({packed:[],stats:null});}}>
                <option value="20GP">{t.ctn20}</option>
                <option value="40GP">{t.ctn40}</option>
                <option value="40HQ">{t.ctn40h}</option>
              </select>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4">
                {[[t.gInner,innerGap,setInnerGap],[t.gDoor,doorGap,setDoorGap],[t.gRight,rightGap,setRightGap],[t.gTop,topGap,setTopGap]].map(([lbl,v,fn],i)=>(
                  <div key={i}>
                    <label className="block text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1">{lbl}</label>
                    <input type="number" min="0" value={v} onChange={e=>fn(Number(e.target.value))} className="w-full p-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none"/>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
              {/* 支撐閾值 */}
              <div className="p-3 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg mb-4">
                <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                  <label className="text-xs font-medium text-amber-800 flex items-center"><Ico.Gear c="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1"/>{t.gSupport}</label>
                  <span className="text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100 px-2 rounded">{suppPct}%</span>
                </div>
                <input type="range" min="20" max="80" step="5" value={suppPct} onChange={e=>setSuppPct(Number(e.target.value))} className="w-full h-2 bg-amber-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-amber-500"/>
                <div className="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-amber-600 mt-1">
                  <span>{t.gSupportL}</span><span>{t.gSupportR}</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg">
                {[[t.dimTotal,c.d+'x'+c.w+'x'+c.h+' mm','text-slate-700'],[t.dimD,Math.max(0,c.d-doorGap-innerGap)+' mm','text-blue-600'],[t.dimW,Math.max(0,c.w-rightGap)+' mm','text-blue-600'],[t.dimH,Math.max(0,c.h-topGap)+' mm','text-blue-600']].map(([lbl,v,cls],i)=>(
                  <div key={i}><span className="block text-[10px] text-slate-400">{lbl}</span><span className={'font-medium text-sm '+cls}>{v}</span></div>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* 箱體設定 */}
            <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
              <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                <h2 className="text-base font-semibold flex items-center"><Ico.Pkg c="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-slate-500"/>{t.boxSet}</h2>
                <button onClick={()=>setBoxes(bs=>[...bs,{id:uid(),name:t.boxPfx+' '+String.fromCharCode(65+bs.length),L:500,W:400,H:300,color:COLORS[bs.length%COLORS.length],qty:0,tolPlus:0,tolMinus:0,calcMode:'nominal'}])} className="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 text-sm flex items-center">
                  <Ico.Plus c="w-4 h-4 mr-1"/>{t.addBox}
                </button>
              </div>
              <div className="space-y-4 max-h-[48vh] overflow-y-auto pr-1 scr">
                {boxes.map(box=>(
                  <div key={box.id} className="p-4 border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg relative group">
                    <button onClick={()=>setBoxes(bs=>bs.filter(b=>b.id!==box.id))} className="absolute top-2 right-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-red-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
                      <Ico.Del c="w-4 h-4"/>
                    </button>
                    <div className="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                      <input type="color" value={box.color} onChange={e=>setBoxes(bs=>bs.map(b=>b.id===box.id?{...b,color:e.target.value}:b))} className="w-6 h-6 rounded border-0 p-0 cursor-pointer"/>
                      <input type="text" value={box.name} onChange={e=>setBoxes(bs=>bs.map(b=>b.id===box.id?{...b,name:e.target.value}:b))} className="flex-1 bg-transparent border-b border-slate-300 focus:border-blue-500 outline-none px-1 text-sm font-medium" placeholder={t.boxName}/>
                    </div>
                    <div className="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2">
                      {[['L',t.fL],['W',t.fW],['H',t.fH],['qty',t.fQ]].map(([f,lbl])=>(
                        <div key={f}>
                          <label className="block text-[10px] text-slate-500 mb-1">{lbl}</label>
                          <input type="number" min={f==='qty'?0:1} value={box[f]} onChange={e=>setBoxes(bs=>bs.map(b=>b.id===box.id?{...b,[f]:Number(e.target.value)}:b))} className="w-full p-1.5 border border-slate-300 rounded text-sm bg-white"/>
                        </div>
                      ))}
                    </div>
                    <div className="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200">
                      <div>
                        <label className="block text-[10px] text-slate-500 mb-1">{t.tPlus}</label>
                        <input type="number" value={box.tolPlus} onChange={e=>setBoxes(bs=>bs.map(b=>b.id===box.id?{...b,tolPlus:Number(e.target.value)}:b))} className="w-full p-1.5 border border-slate-300 rounded text-xs bg-white"/>
                      </div>
                      <div>
                        <label className="block text-[10px] text-slate-500 mb-1">{t.tMinus}</label>
                        <input type="number" value={box.tolMinus} onChange={e=>setBoxes(bs=>bs.map(b=>b.id===box.id?{...b,tolMinus:Number(e.target.value)}:b))} className="w-full p-1.5 border border-slate-300 rounded text-xs bg-white"/>
                      </div>
                      <div className="col-span-2">
                        <label className="block text-[10px] text-slate-500 mb-1">{t.calcMode}</label>
                        <select value={box.calcMode} onChange={e=>setBoxes(bs=>bs.map(b=>b.id===box.id?{...b,calcMode:e.target.value}:b))} className="w-full p-1.5 border border-slate-300 rounded text-xs bg-white">
                          <option value="nominal">{t.mNom}</option>
                          <option value="max">{t.mMax}</option>
                          <option value="min">{t.mMin}</option>
                          <option value="mid">{t.mMid}</option>
                        </select>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    {box.calcMode!=='nominal'&&(
                      <div className="mt-2 text-[11px] text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 p-1.5 rounded font-medium">
                        {t.mLabel} {box.calcMode==='max'?(box.L+box.tolPlus)+' x '+(box.W+box.tolPlus)+' x '+(box.H+box.tolPlus):box.calcMode==='min'?(box.L-box.tolMinus)+' x '+(box.W-box.tolMinus)+' x '+(box.H-box.tolMinus):(box.L+(box.tolPlus-box.tolMinus)/2)+' x '+(box.W+(box.tolPlus-box.tolMinus)/2)+' x '+(box.H+(box.tolPlus-box.tolMinus)/2)}
                      </div>
                    )}
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
              <div className="mt-4 p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg">
                <label className="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">{t.stratTitle}</label>
                <select value={strat} onChange={e=>setStrat(e.target.value)} className="w-full p-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none">
                  <option value="auto">{t.stratAuto}</option>
                  <option value="length">{t.stratL}</option>
                  <option value="width">{t.stratW}</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-4">
                <button onClick={()=>doCalc(false)} disabled={loading} className="flex items-center justify-center bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-medium py-3 rounded-lg disabled:opacity-50 transition-colors text-sm shadow-sm">
                  {loading&&!graspOn?<Ico.Spin c="w-4 h-4 animate-spin mr-1.5"/>:<Ico.Play c="w-4 h-4 mr-1.5"/>}
                  {loading&&!graspOn?t.calcIng:t.calcBtn}
                </button>
                <div className="flex flex-col">
                  <button onClick={()=>doCalc(true)} disabled={loading} className="flex items-center justify-center bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-medium py-3 rounded-lg disabled:opacity-50 transition-colors text-sm shadow-sm">
                    {graspOn?<Ico.Spin c="w-4 h-4 animate-spin mr-1.5"/>:<Ico.Star c="w-4 h-4 mr-1.5"/>}
                    {graspOn?(t.graspIng+' '+progress+'%'):t.graspBtn}
                  </button>
                  {graspOn&&(
                    <div className="h-1.5 bg-slate-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-1.5 mx-0.5">
                      <div className="prog-bar" style={{width:progress+'%'}}></div>
                    </div>
                  )}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* 右側 3D */}
          <div className="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div className="bg-white p-2 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 relative" style={{height:'620px'}}>
              {/* 凡例 */}
              <div className="absolute top-3 left-3 z-10 flex flex-col gap-1 pointer-events-none">
                {boxes.map(b=>(
                  <div key={b.id} className="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center text-[10px]">
                    <span className="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full mr-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style={{backgroundColor:b.color}}></span>
                    <span className="font-medium text-slate-700 truncate max-w-[120px]">{b.name}</span>
                  </div>
                ))}
                {result.stats?.rem&&hasPacked&&(
                  <div className="bg-white/95 backdrop-blur p-2.5 rounded border border-slate-200 shadow-sm mt-1 pointer-events-auto w-max">
                    <div className="flex items-center text-slate-800 font-bold text-xs mb-1.5"><Ico.Rule c="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1 text-blue-600"/>{t.remTitle}</div>
                    <div className="flex gap-3 text-xs">
                      {[[t.remD,'d',doorGap,'text-orange-600'],[t.remW,'w',rightGap,'text-blue-600'],[t.remH,'h',topGap,'text-green-600']].map(([lbl,k,gv,cls],idx)=>(
                        <div key={k} className={'flex flex-col'+(idx>0?' border-l border-slate-200 pl-3':'')}>
                          <span className="text-slate-400 font-bold mb-1">{lbl}</span>
                          {result.stats.rem[k].map((g,i)=>(
                            <div key={i} className="mb-1 last:mb-0">
                              <span className={'font-bold block '+cls}>{g}mm</span>
                              <span className="text-[9px] text-slate-400">{t.remInc}: {g+gv}mm</span>
                            </div>
                          ))}
                        </div>
                      ))}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
              {/* 視角ボタン */}
              <div className="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 flex gap-1.5">
                {[['iso',t.vIso],['top',t.vTop],['front',t.vFront],['side',t.vSide]].map(([v,lbl])=>(
                  <button key={v} onClick={()=>changeView(v)} className="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur text-slate-700 hover:text-blue-600 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-slate-200 text-[11px] font-medium shadow-sm">{lbl}</button>
                ))}
              </div>
              {/* キャンバス */}
              <div ref={canvasRef} className="rounded-lg cursor-move touch-none bg-slate-100" style={{position:'absolute',top:'8px',left:'8px',right:'8px',bottom:'8px'}}></div>
              {/* 操作ヒント */}
              <div className="hint-overlay">
                <span><span className="hint-key">{lang==='zh'?'左鍵':'左ボタン'}</span>{lang==='zh'?'旋轉':'回転'}</span>
                <span><span className="hint-key">{lang==='zh'?'右鍵':'右ボタン'}</span>{lang==='zh'?'平移':'移動'}</span>
                <span><span className="hint-key">{lang==='zh'?'滾輪':'ホイール'}</span>{lang==='zh'?'縮放':'縮尺'}</span>
              </div>
              {/* 裝載順序バー */}
              {hasPacked&&(
                <div className="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border border-slate-200 p-2.5 rounded-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 z-20">
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 flex-shrink-0">
                    <span className="flex items-center text-blue-700 font-bold text-xs bg-blue-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">
                      <Ico.Play c="w-3 h-3 mr-1"/>{t.play}{step}/{result.packed.length}
                    </span>
                    <label className="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs transition-colors">
                      <input type="checkbox" checked={xray} onChange={e=>setXray(e.target.checked)} className="w-3 h-3 rounded accent-blue-600"/>
                      <Ico.Eye c="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500"/>
                      <span className="text-slate-700">{t.xray}</span>
                    </label>
                  </div>
                  <div className="flex-grow flex items-center gap-2 w-full">
                    <span className="text-[10px] text-slate-400 whitespace-nowrap">{t.inner}</span>
                    <input type="range" min="0" max={result.packed.length} value={step} onChange={e=>setStep(Number(e.target.value))} className="w-full h-1.5 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-blue-600 bg-slate-200"/>
                    <span className="text-[10px] text-slate-400 whitespace-nowrap">{t.door}</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              )}
            </div>

            {/* 結果サマリ */}
            {result.stats&&(
              <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 space-y-4">
                <h3 className="text-base font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
                  <Ico.Chk c="w-5 h-5 mr-2 text-green-500"/>{t.sumTitle}
                </h3>
                <div className="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
                  <div className="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                    <p className="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">{t.totBox}</p>
                    <p className="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">{result.stats.total}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div className="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100">
                    <p className="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">{t.util}</p>
                    <p className="text-xl font-bold text-blue-600">{result.stats.util}%</p>
                  </div>
                  <div className="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 col-span-2">
                    <p className="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">{t.effVol}</p>
                    <p className="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">{(result.stats.vol/1e9).toFixed(2)} m³ <span className="text-xs font-normal text-slate-400">/ {t.totVol} {((c.w*c.h*c.d)/1e9).toFixed(2)}m³</span></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p className="text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 mb-2">{t.detail}</p>
                  <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                    {boxes.map(b=>{
                      const cnt=result.stats.counts[b.id]||0;
                      if(cnt===0&&b.qty===0) return null;
                      return (
                        <div key={b.id} className="flex justify-between items-center p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm">
                          <span className="flex items-center font-medium text-slate-700">
                            <span className="w-3 h-3 rounded-full mr-2 flex-shrink-0" style={{backgroundColor:b.color}}></span>
                            {b.name}
                          </span>
                          <span className={'font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded '+(b.qty>0&&cnt<b.qty?'bg-red-100 text-red-700':'bg-slate-100 text-slate-700')}>
                            {cnt}{b.qty>0?' / '+b.qty:''} {t.boxU}
                          </span>
                        </div>
                      );
                    })}
                  </div>
                </div>
                {result.stats.warns?.length>0&&(
                  <div className="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl p-4">
                    <h4 className="flex items-center text-orange-800 font-bold mb-2 text-sm"><Ico.Warn c="w-4 h-4 mr-2"/>{t.warnTitle}</h4>
                    <ul className="space-y-1.5 mb-3">
                      {result.stats.warns.map((w,i)=>(
                        <li key={i} className="flex items-center justify-between bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded border border-orange-100 text-sm">
                          <span className="flex items-center font-medium">
                            <span className="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full mr-2" style={{backgroundColor:w.color}}></span>
                            {w.name}
                          </span>
                          <span className="text-orange-700 font-semibold text-xs">{t.wShort} {w.lack} {t.boxU} ({t.wReq} {w.req}/{t.wPack} {w.pk})</span>
                        </li>
                      ))}
                    </ul>
                    <p className="text-xs text-slate-600">{t.wAnal}</p>
                    <p className="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">{t.wSug}</p>
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
            )}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')).render(React.createElement(App));
</script>
</body>
</html>
